-# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-# A session driven by the planner. This is the shape the engine's
-# SessionWorkflow calls into (through an activity, since the receipt chain
-# is on disk); the acceptance suite drives it directly.
-# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
